
; Donations use the check date so that they get aggregated the correct
; date as understood by the donor, when I send acknowledgements.
2026-01-14 * "donation, check # 1001" #acknowledged
    deposit-date: 2026-11-01
    Assets:OperatingFund:Checking 123.45 USD
    Expenses:Fees:Checking 0.55 USD
    Income:Donor:DoeJohn -124.00 USD
    
